OL,3,A'Bold and inventive' Canadian poet Anne
OL,4,ACarson wins Nobel Literature Prize
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Nobel Prize is awarded for a
OL,7,Flifetime's body of work and is regarded
OL,8,Fas the most prestigious award in global
OL,9,Fliterature, with the winner receiving
OL,10,F12 million Swedish kronor (#900,000,
OL,11,F$1.2m).
